group gui
note One selection for the whole app: a symbol, with a step behind it when it was reached through a path. Every view reads the same three fields - the focused symbol, the path being read and the selected step - and none keeps a copy: the graph derives its whole node set from them every frame, and the document and outline read them directly, so the three cannot disagree. Two entry points: select_step for anything path-shaped, select_symbol for anything else; select_symbol turns into select_step when the symbol is a whole-symbol step of the path being read, so an xref click onto a step lands on the step.

