note The graph reads the same two fields and keeps nothing of its own: every frame it derives its node set from the selected path and the focused symbol, so it cannot disagree with the document or the outline. The path is drawn whenever one is selected, step or no step: selecting a symbol off the path adds it as another root beside the path rather than replacing it.

